SOLUTION 1
    units mmol/kgw
    C(4) 50
    pH 7 charge
SOLUTION 2
    units mmol/kgw
    Ca 50
    pH 12 charge
MIX 1
    1 1.0
    2 1.0
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Calcite 0 0
REACTION_TEMPERATURE 1
    20 40 60 80 100 120 140 160 180 200
SELECTED_OUTPUT 1
    -file output.sel
    -temperature
    -ionic_strength
END
